      en: ["Capital of Santa Bárbara Department", "Center for junco palm crafts", "Surrounded by hills", "Colonial church"],
      es: ["Cabecera del departamento de Santa Bárbara", "Centro de artesanía de junco", "Rodeada de colinas", "Iglesia colonial"],
