      en: ["Rebuilt as 'Nueva Ocotepeque' starting in the late 1930s.", "Serves as the primary logistics hub for El Salvador trade.", "The original city was founded in the 16th century.", "Location of the strategic Agua Caliente border crossing.", "The surrounding mountains reach altitudes over 2,000 meters.", "Major employer is the customs and transportation sector.", "The city center features a large central park and modern cathedral.", "Home to diverse wildlife within the Trifinio biosphere."],
